[2026-07-24T16:39:54.938Z] tool=Bash command=git add daemon/Monitor.cpp daemon/IPC_Server.cpp && git commit -m "Fix transitions on static images spinning to completion in one frame  resumeTransition() called render() unconditionally on every frame. Since m_transitionState is still set mid-transition, this recursed back into resumeTransition() on every frame, spinning the entire animation to completion in a single onFrame() callback with no visible animation. On multi-monitor setups this caused monitors to update sequentially.  Move render() inside if (progress >= 1.0f) so it only fires once after the transition ends, letting the event loop pace each frame normally.  Also fix typo in error message: ~/cache/yin -> ~/.cache/yin"
